        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Booking is simple: call our 24/7 helpline, fill the online request form with your pickup and drop addresses, and specify any special items. Within minutes you’ll receive a verified quote, and a dedicated relocation manager will confirm the schedule, ensuring a hassle‑free start to your move.</p>
