        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every shipment is covered by a 100 % declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. It protects against loss, theft, accidental damage, and natural hazards during the entire journey. The policy details, claim procedure, and coverage limits are explained in the contract, giving you full peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are charges calculated for small‑truck house shifting in Balkum?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Charges are based on truck size, total weight, distance, number of staircases, and any fragile or oversized items. A base rate per kilometer is applied, with additional fees for packing material, insurance, and special handling. Our transparent cost matrix breaks down each component so you know exactly what you pay.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken when transporting vehicles from Balkum?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Vehicles are loaded onto enclosed multi‑car trailers equipped with hydraulic ramps, wheel chocks, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. Each vehicle is inspected, photographed, and logged before loading. Real‑time GPS tracking and periodic security checks ensure safe transit until delivery at the destination hub.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my belongings live during the 850 km transit from Balkum?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All our trucks are fitted with satellite GPS devices that feed live location data to our customer portal. You receive a unique tracking ID, allowing you to monitor the exact position of your shipment, estimated arrival time, and any route updates in real time.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What red flags should I watch for when hiring Packers And Movers In Balkum?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Beware of movers who demand full payment upfront, lack proper licensing, or cannot provide a GST invoice. Unclear insurance terms, missing IBA approval, and vague cost breakdowns are also warning signs. Choose a provider with verified reviews, transparent pricing, and documented certifications to avoid scams.</p>
